      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a Faridabad to another state relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, the GSTIN of the moving company, an e‑Way bill for goods in transit, and a signed insurance declaration covering the declared value of your items. Keeping these documents handy ensures smooth checkpost clearance and claim processing if needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my household goods during the Faridabad‑to‑hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All Shree Ashirwad trucks are equipped with satellite GPS that provides live location updates. The tracking link is shared with you once the load departs, allowing you to monitor progress, estimated arrival times, and any route deviations in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packaging protect fragile items like glassware?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for extra rigidity. Each layer absorbs shocks, prevents vibration, and shields against moisture, ensuring glassware arrives intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical rates for packers and movers in Faridabad for a 2‑BHK apartment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Rates vary based on distance, volume, and service level, but a standard 2‑BHK shift within Faridabad averages between ₹8,000‑₹12,000. For inter‑state moves, the cost includes a base fare, distance surcharge, weight‑based charges, and optional insurance, which together can range from ₹20,000‑₹35,000.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a mobile app to schedule and monitor my furniture shift from Faridabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, Shree Ashirwad offers a dedicated furniture shifting app that lets you request an instant estimate, book the service, and track the truck live. The app also stores all documentation, provides push notifications for checkpoint clearances, and allows you to rate the service after delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken for transporting two‑wheelers from Faridabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Two‑wheelers are loaded onto specialized carriers equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. The hydraulic loading ramp ensures gentle placement, while the vehicle is secured with multiple tie‑down points and monitored by CCTV throughout the journey for added security.</p>
      </div>
